OL,3,A'Looksmaxxing' influencer Clavicular
OL,4,Apleads not guilty to rape charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FClavicular, a social media influencer
OL,7,Fwho promotes the "looksmaxxing" trend
OL,8,Fof young men maximising their
OL,9,Fattractiveness, has pleaded not guilty
OL,10,Fto criminal charges including rape.
OL,12,FThe 20-year-old, whose real name is
OL,13,FBraden Peters, was charged in September
OL,14,Fwith felony rape, drugging an
OL,15,Findividual for sexual intercourse and
OL,16,Fprocuring alcohol for someone under the
OL,17,Fage of 21.
OL,19,FThe charges stem from an incident in
OL,20,F2025 when he is accused of assaulting a
OL,21,F17-year-old girl at his family's
OL,22,FMassachusetts home.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
