OL,3,A'Looksmaxxing' influencer Clavicular
OL,4,Apleads not guilty to rape charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeters has denied the allegations and
OL,7,Fsaid the encounter was consensual. On
OL,8,FThursday, he was granted $10,000 bail,
OL,9,Fordered not to contact or post about
OL,10,Fhis accuser, and to surrender his
OL,11,Fpassport.
